{:edb/db-before-t 2164 :edb/db-after-t 2165 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535477 50 #inst "2026-10-09T00:53:12.996Z" 13194139535477 true] [17592186351029 1017 #edb/ref 17592186351030 13194139535477 false] [17592186351029 1017 #edb/ref 17592186351170 13194139535477 true] [17592186351029 1100 "$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}\\boxed{}\\,\\text{d}A\n$$\n\nConsider the surface integral of the function \n$f(x,y,z)={x}^{2}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}$ \nover the parametric surface \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨{u}^{2},\\,v,\\,v⟩\n$$\n\nfor $(u,v)\\in D⊆{R}^{2}.$ Use the scalar surface-area factor $\\|r_u\\times r_v\\|$ with its absolute values for the stated parameter domain. What is the missing expression?\n\n*Hint: You can use the fact that $‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=\\sqrt{8}|u|.$*" 13194139535477 true] [17592186351029 1100 "$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}\\boxed{}\\,\\text{d}A\n$$\n\nConsider the surface integral of the function \n$f(x,y,z)={x}^{2}{y}^{2}{z}^{2}$ \nover the parametric surface \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨{u}^{2},\\,v,\\,v⟩\n$$\n\nfor $(u,v)\\in D⊆{R}^{2}.$ What is the missing expression?\n\n*Hint: You can use the fact that $‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=\\sqrt{8}u.$*" 13194139535477 false] [17592186351029 1145 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface integral of a scalar function $f$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nNotice that we are told that the norm of the fundamental vector product for our surface is\n\n$$\n‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖=\\sqrt{8}u.\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $f(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(u,v)) & =({x}^{2}{y}^{2}{z}^{2})\\,{|}_{x={u}^{2}\\,y=v\\,z=v} \\\\  & =({u}^{2}\\cdot {u}^{2})\\cdot {v}^{2}\\cdot {v}^{2}\\, \\\\  & ={u}^{4}{v}^{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(r(u,v))‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,\\sqrt{8}\\,{u}^{5}{v}^{4}\\,\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535477 false] [17592186351029 1145 "The scalar surface-area factor is nonnegative. For $r(u,v)=(u^2,v,v)$,\n\n$$r_u=(2u,0,0),\\qquad r_v=(0,1,1),\\qquad r_u\\times r_v=(0,-2u,2u).$$\n\nHence\n\n$$\\|r_u\\times r_v\\|=\\sqrt{8u^2}=\\sqrt8\\,|u|.$$\n\nSubstitution into $f(x,y,z)=x^2y^2z^2$ gives\n\n$$f(r(u,v))=(u^2)^2v^2v^2=u^4v^4.$$\n\nThe missing integrand for the stated general parameter domain is therefore\n\n$$\\sqrt8\\,u^4v^4|u|.$$\n\nThe original hint and source key used $\\sqrt8\\,u$ and $\\sqrt8\\,u^5v^4$, respectively, without restricting $u$. They are valid for $u\\ge0$ but fail for negative $u$. At $(u,v)=(-1,1)$ the correct integrand is $\\sqrt8$; the signed source expression gives $-\\sqrt8$, although the scalar function is nonnegative. This correction retains the original general domain, fixes the hint, and adds the absolute-value choice.\n\nThe parametrization loses rank at $u=0$. The displayed surface-integral equality has the usual requirement of regular patches and no multiple coverage except on negligible boundaries; the local area factor remains $\\sqrt8|u|$." 13194139535477 true] [17592186351170 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351031 13194139535477 true] [17592186351170 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351032 13194139535477 true] [17592186351170 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351033 13194139535477 true] [17592186351170 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351034 13194139535477 true] [17592186351170 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351035 13194139535477 true] [17592186351170 1000 #edb/ref 17592186351171 13194139535477 true] [17592186351170 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535477 true] [17592186351170 1041 "selection" 13194139535477 true] [17592186351170 1104 #edb/ref 17592186351171 13194139535477 true] [17592186351170 1110 #uuid "57e0241f-39f2-5746-aa50-6d39b2135aef" 13194139535477 true] [17592186351171 1034 "\\sqrt{8}\\,{u}^{4}{v}^{4}|u|" 13194139535477 true] [17592186351171 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535477 true] [17592186351171 1111 #uuid "6791b055-8e8e-5390-bc51-c28f49dd0783" 13194139535477 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-161134/absolute-u-v1/selection" 17592186351170 "q-161134/absolute-u-v1/selection/correct-answer" 17592186351171} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
